# Which app fastlane is talking about. The bundle id is a build variable rather
# than a literal — the listing's identifier is a fact about a deployment, not
# about the code — and app.config.js reads the same one, with the same
# development fallback. `fastlane metadata`'s preflight fails if the two drift.
app_identifier(ENV["APP_BUNDLE_ID"] || "dev.local.adastrail")

# The Apple Account email comes from the environment because it is personal
# data. The team id is read the same way for symmetry rather than for secrecy —
# it is not a credential, and eas.json has to commit the same value as a literal
# because EAS interpolates no environment variable into `appleTeamId`. Set both
# in native/.env (gitignored) or the shell; store-preflight fails if the team id
# here and the one in eas.json disagree.
apple_id(ENV["APPLE_ID"])
itc_team_id(ENV["ASC_TEAM_ID"])
team_id(ENV["APPLE_TEAM_ID"])
